  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">An Exhibition: Showcasing Stories and Images from Youth Farmers Seminar.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The engagement activity will be a public exhibition showcasing the pilot project&apos;s journey, challenges, and successes via presentations, photos, and stories. The main message emphasizes how empowering rural youth with knowledge and resources can drive sustainable agricultural practices and foster economic growth within their communities. Targeted toward young Danes and Danish citizens interested in development and sustainability, as well as NGOs and organizations in related fields, the exhibition will invite viewers to witness the impact of supporting youth in agriculture as a catalyst for positive change.</narrative>
  </description>
